###> symfony/framework-bundle ###
# Only `.env.dist` and `.env.e2e.dist` are versioned.
# Install: `cp .env.dist .env.local` and `cp .env.e2e.dist .env.e2e.local` (or `make up` / `make up-e2e`).
# Never commit secrets. Working files: `.env.local` and `.env.e2e.local` (gitignored).
